\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl240\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Tag Copy and Tag Copy/Delete Original are mutually exclusive inventory copy modes. Checking either box only selects the mode. After you click Inventory, TLO opens the same destination-entry window and requires an existing full path with readable available-space information. Tag Copy states that originals are retained. Tag Copy/Delete Original adds the warning that originals are removed after verified transfer. Before changes begin, TLO checks the exact required source size against destination capacity.}
